    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "ポスターの改善案が\nあると聞いたが？",
            "enText": "So I hear you have a suggestion \nfor one of our posters?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 8525006596771294172,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マルゼンスキー",
            "enName": "Maruzensky",
            "jpText": "そう！　もうちょいナウい方が\nいいかな～って思うのよ。",
            "enText": "Yup! And I just know the groovy cats \nat this school are gonna love it!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 233131877350573686,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マルゼンスキー",
            "enName": "Maruzensky",
            "jpText": "凱旋門をバックにした表紙とか\nマブくてよさげじゃない？",
            "enText": "Why not put the Arc de Triomphe in the \nbackground? I bet it'd look super rad!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -1899093247467638135,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "なるほど……。\nその件は広報に伝えておこう。",
            "enText": "Quite the idea… I'll have to let the public \nrelations office know.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 8903052645017012825,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "ところでマルゼンスキー。個人的な\n質問をしても構わないか？",
            "enText": "On a more personal note… \nMaruzensky, may I ask you a question?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -2240861616419319314,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マルゼンスキー",
            "enName": "Maruzensky",
            "jpText": "なんでもござれ～！",
            "enText": "Sure! Ask away!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -6929910503925390085,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "『ナウい』とは、\n近頃流行ってる言葉か？",
            "enText": "Is \"groovy\" one of those terms \nthat is fashionable nowadays?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 1709120418711981893,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "流行には疎くてな。\nよければ教示願いたいのだが。",
            "enText": "I am a bit behind the times when it comes \nto slang. Could I trouble you to teach me \na few words?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -2921976488962527155,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マルゼンスキー",
            "enName": "Maruzensky",
            "jpText": "うふふっ、問題ナッシ～ング☆\r\nあたしが色々教えてア・ゲ・ル！",
            "enText": "Hehehe, no problemo!☆ When it comes \nto slang, I'm your gal!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 923436795832261416,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "ありがとう。エアグルーヴたちの\n驚く顔が目に浮かぶな、ふふっ。",
            "enText": "Thank you. I can't wait to see the look on \nAir Groove and the others' faces. Haha.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 3867652920388029102,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1776630838,
    "humanTl": true
}